# "This spell costs {1} less to cast if you control a Spirit. It also costs {1} less ... an enchantment": Bot1 controls neither,
# so the Snare costs the full {2}{U} (two Moxen are short, three pay it exactly). Bot2's Mausoleum Wanderer (a Spirit) and Fang of
# Shigeki (an enchantment) are not Bot1's, so they reduce nothing. Bot2 has no mana left for the {3}: its Ornithopter is countered.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Geistlight Snare
Island x3
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Mausoleum Wanderer
Fang of Shigeki
Ornithopter
Island x2
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Mausoleum Wanderer.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Fang of Shigeki.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Geistlight Snare.Cast(Stack.Ornithopter)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Geistlight Snare
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter = (absent)
